sequenceDiagram
  participant A as ORBIT Agent
  participant G as Policy Gateway
  participant B as Desktop Broker
  participant N as Local Node
  participant D as agent-desktop
  participant OS as Native App / OS
  A->>G: Request observation
  G->>G: Tenant + device + lease check
  G->>B: Forward request
  B->>N: Authenticated WSS request
  N->>N: Local session + allowlist check
  N->>D: Snapshot via fixed argv
  D->>OS: Accessibility read
  OS-->>D: Accessibility tree
  D-->>N: Structured snapshot
  N-->>B: Redacted observation
  B-->>G: Observation
  G-->>A: Snapshot + completeness
  A->>G: One typed action against snapshot ref
  G->>G: Recompute semantic risk / approval
  G->>B: Approved leased action
  B->>N: Authenticated request
  N->>D: Execute once
  D->>OS: Semantic action
  OS-->>D: Delivery/result evidence
  D-->>N: Structured disposition
  N-->>G: Action receipt
  G-->>A: Delivery receipt
  A->>G: Fresh verification observation
